graph TD
  accTitle: Powerplants One navigation architecture, page level, proposed
  accDescr: Six capability domains, each a subgraph of hubs, pages, actions and reserved slots under its owning rail, including the Reports workspace for domain 5. Dotted arrows are cross-domain handovers HO-02 to HO-23 and interfaces to MYOB and SharePoint.
  %% Powerplants One - navigation architecture, page level, proposed, revised 9 October 2026 (NAD-08 Reports workspace adopted)
  %% Theme: the init line pins colours. The font is left to the renderer: Mermaid directives reject font lists.
  %% Labels follow the built registry src/shell/navigation.ts; each working area names its owning department rail.
  %% Shapes: stadium = hub or working area, rectangle = page, double-edged rectangle = modal or action, cylinder = external authority
  %% Classes: page = route in the synthetic prototype, proposed = needs a decision, reserved = registry slot withheld today,
  %% external = MYOB or SharePoint, excluded = out of scope
  %% Solid arrows = primary navigation. Dotted arrows = cross-domain handover HO-nn or interface IF-nn.

  classDef shell fill:#242a37,stroke:#242a37,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold
  classDef hub fill:#ffffff,stroke:#242a37,stroke-width:2px,color:#242a37,font-weight:bold
  classDef page fill:#ffffff,stroke:#828e9f,color:#242a37
  classDef proposed fill:#fff5df,stroke:#865900,color:#865900,stroke-dasharray:5 3
  classDef reserved fill:#f5f6f8,stroke:#606977,color:#4a5260,stroke-dasharray:3 3
  classDef action fill:#edf3f8,stroke:#365875,color:#365875
  classDef external fill:#eef0f3,stroke:#606977,color:#4a5260
  classDef excluded fill:#fef3f2,stroke:#b42318,color:#b42318,stroke-dasharray:2 2

